## SpecKit Tools Reference

### Creating and Managing Specifications

| Tool | Purpose | When to Use |
|------|---------|------------|
| `/speckit-specify` | Create new specification with template | Starting new feature work |
| `/speckit-clarify` | Resolve ambiguities and clarifications | After initial spec draft, before planning |
| `/speckit-plan` | Generate technical implementation plan | After spec is clarified and approved |
| `/speckit-tasks` | Decompose feature into actionable tasks | After plan is complete; before implementation |

### Example Workflow

```bash
# 1. Create new specification
/speckit-specify "My new feature description"

# 2. Clarify any ambiguous requirements
/speckit-clarify

# 3. Plan technical approach and architecture
/speckit-plan

# 4. Decompose into implementation tasks
/speckit-tasks

# 5. Implement tasks (developer responsibility)
# 6. Submit PR for review when implementation complete
```

