## Common Operations Reference

### List All Specifications

```bash
ls -1 .github/specs/ | grep '^[0-9][0-9][0-9]-'
```

### Find Highest Specification Number

```bash
bash .specify/scripts/bash/audit-specs.sh | grep "Sequential numbering"
```

### Count Specifications

```bash
ls -1d .github/specs/[0-9][0-9][0-9]-*/ | wc -l
```

### Validate Numbering

```bash
bash .specify/scripts/bash/audit-specs.sh
```

This will report:
- Total specifications found
- Naming compliance (✓ or ✗ for each)
- Sequential numbering verification
- spec.md presence check

