## Maintenance Responsibilities Checklist

### Monthly Tasks

- [ ] Verify catalog currency: check "Last Updated" date is recent
- [ ] Spot-check 1-2 random specs: confirm quality dimensions still valid
- [ ] Review any archived specs: ensure they remain marked as archived

### Quarterly Tasks

- [ ] Run full audit: `bash .specify/scripts/bash/audit-specs.sh`
- [ ] Validate all catalog entries against actual specifications
- [ ] Document any patterns (common gaps, quality trends)
- [ ] Report metrics to governance authority

### After Adding New Spec (Always)

- [ ] Update CATALOG.md within 7 days
- [ ] Mark status as Active after approval
- [ ] Verify numbering is sequential (no gaps)
- [ ] Confirm quality checklist all items passing

